{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>iScreen 是一款專為 iPhone 設計的 AI 壁紙應用，提供精心挑選的高品質背景，讓用戶輕鬆升級螢幕畫面。目前正進行終生版限時免費活動，適合喜歡個性化桌布又想省錢的用家。</p>\n\n<h2>精選分類與自訂功能</h2>\n<p>應用內建多種風格分類，包括夢幻、暗黑、未來感、極簡、動漫等，定期更新內容保持新鮮感。用戶可在儲存前為壁紙加入自訂文字，建立一致的視覺風格，並一鍵儲存或分享。PRO 版本解鎖無限下載與完整內容存取。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-177-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-178-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-179-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-180-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-181-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-182-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>iScreen: 桌布與壁紙 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：iScreen: 桌布與壁紙</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-28T13:10:16.166177+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":363,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}